# Fallout 4's character creation, standing in for either source game's; run it before an opening's folder:
#   python -m tools.live.fo4_story_cases tests/story/fo4_creation.f4test tests/story/fo3_opening --set SEX=male
# Started from a coc: stage 5 of the new game quest runs Fallout 4's opening by hand (MQ101 stage 0:
# its movie, then the mirror), and leaving the sink starts the source game (docs/fork/fo4_pipeline.md#character-creation).

case fo4_character_creation
run coc QASmoke
ready 240
run setstage FNV_NewGame 5
menu 120 PlayBinkMenu                                 # Fallout 4's intro movie, interruptible
wait 2
press T                                               # the first T shows the skip prompt (Esc does nothing)
wait 1
press T                                               # the second skips
menu 400 LooksMenu                                    # the mirror scene opens the character creation
${SEX=male:wait 1,female:call LooksMenu ChangeSex}    # from Nate to Nora
close 30 LooksMenu                                    # its Done (once Nora's face loaded): the Confirm box
answer 30 OK
wait 2
press 1 W                                             # leave the sink: MQ101PlayerScript ends the mirror
expect player.GetIsSex Female == ${SEX=male:0,female:1}
end
